<section class="container kube-reading mx-auto px-5 py-16">
  <p class="kube-label">About CloudSecCorner</p>
  <h1>Making agentic cloud security practical and accessible</h1>
  <p class="kube-dek">CloudSecCorner is dedicated to demystifying the intersection of autonomous AI agents, cloud infrastructure, and practical defensive engineering.</p>
  <div class="kube-markdown mt-8 space-y-6">
    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <p>We make agentic cloud security practical. We create and curate guidance for identity, authorization, tool isolation, runtime defense, threat modeling, evaluations, governance, and incident response.</p>
    <h2>Who we bring together</h2>
    <p>Security practitioners, cloud engineers, AI builders, and governance teams collaborate to develop controls that keep autonomous systems useful, observable, and bounded.</p>
    <h2>Contribute</h2>
    <p>Help improve a lab, add a tool, or share a field note. Start with the <a href="https://github.com/CloudSecCorner/cloudseccorner.github.io/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">contribution guide</a> or join the <a href="https://discord.gg/aUD4hkYYGt" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">community Discord</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
